From 1b44733d41fafe3664c0ccebaa6076898ba64000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Liang Kaiwen <liangkaiwen24@mails.ucas.ac.cn>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:57:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sched/chimera: bound NACK retries and clean proposal resources

Classify NACK reasons and apply a 100 ms retry delay. Invalidate suppression on assignment, capability and balance changes. Scan all task threads for timeout and release reservations when sighand is gone.

Source-Commit: 1b44733d41fafe3664c0ccebaa6076898ba64000

---
